# Quy Trình Làm Việc & Triển Khai

## Development Workflow
1. Feature branches từ main
2. Conventional commits
3. Pull requests với code review
4. CI/CD checks phải pass
5. Squash merge vào main

## Environment Setup
- Node.js 18+
- PostgreSQL 14+
- Redis cho caching
- Environment variables theo [.env.local](mdc:.env.local)

## Build Process
1. Type checking
2. Linting
3. Tests
4. Build production bundle
5. Generate static assets

## Deployment
- Production: Vercel
- Staging: Preview deployments
- Database: Managed PostgreSQL
- Monitoring: Vercel Analytics

## Performance Requirements
- Lighthouse score > 90
- First contentful paint < 1.5s
- Time to interactive < 3.5s
- Bundle size < 200KB (gzipped)

## Monitoring
- Error tracking
- Performance monitoring
- User analytics
- Server metrics

## Backup & Recovery
- Daily database backups
- Point-in-time recovery
- Disaster recovery plan
- Backup testing schedule

## Security Measures
- Regular security audits
- Dependency updates
- Penetration testing
- Security headers

